  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Sawin's totally real towers (Lean 4.35.0)",
  "excerpt": "This Lean component of [NYLL](https://github.com/n-yamaguchi-0729/NYLL) develops Sawin’s theorem on totally real fields of unbounded degree and bounded root discriminant, together with Martinet’s corollary and Shafarevich’s relation-rank bound. The [mathematical guide](https://n-yamaguchi-0729.github.io/NYLL/libraries/sawin-totally-real-towers/) describes these three results and their relationship to the formalized benchmark statements."
 },
